INSERT INTO simple_book_view
VALUES
(11, 'Machine Learning Basics', 'AI', 850, 5, 'Available');

⚠️ This will work only if the omitted columns in the underlying books table allow NULL.

Your original table has author, rating, city, and publisher without NOT NULL, so MySQL can insert NULL values for them.

25. Available books with CHECK OPTION
